  m_Name: Risk
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BingoGameRuleData
  ruleType: 2
  description: Complete and submit marked Bingo patterns to earn points. A completed
    pattern that is not submitted during its timed opportunity can still be checked
    later, but it awards no points. After a successful check, choose Keep Playing
    to risk your temporary score for more points or End My Game to secure it. A bad
    check, the Risk timer ending, or the ball pool ending while you are still playing
    causes a loss and discards your temporary score.
